    "Description": "Creates and applies delta files between OCI image archives for bootc systems. Delta files are significantly smaller than full OCI archives because they exclude layers already present on the target system and use binary diffs (tar-diff) for changed layers.\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Update oci-delta to v0.3.1 for RHEL 9.9.z async release (JIRA:RHEL-294259)",
